{
  "_comment": "Lightweight SKOS-style taxonomy for the engram-mcp server. `label` ~ skos:prefLabel, `broader` ~ skos:broader. A simple SDLC concept tree the recall pipeline uses to broaden/narrow queries. Extend it with your own concepts; every concept needs a `label`, and `broader` must name another label (or be omitted for a root).",
